{"gems":{"name":"hypertabular","downloads":5111,"version":"1.1.0","version_created_at":"2026-11-15T05:52:31.711Z","version_downloads":57,"platform":"ruby","ruby_abi":null,"authors":"Brian Buvinghausen","info":"CSV, TSV and any single-byte ASCII separator, and XLSX, ODS and Numbers workbooks, read by a\nnative Rust core into typed column batches. The core owns no memory: this gem allocates the buffers once and the\ncore fills them in one native call per batch. Every cell is a HyperCast verdict — the\nvalue, or a reason plus the offending span — and a file that is not rows of cells at\nall is an exception raised after the intact rows. Two backends behind one surface,\nselected automatically and both shipped prebuilt: a Magnus extension where a precompiled\nplatform gem matches, and stdlib Fiddle everywhere else. No compile on install.\n","licenses":["MIT","Unicode-3.0"],"metadata":{"changelog_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular","documentation_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular/tree/master/ruby#readme","rubygems_mfa_required":"true"},"yanked":false,"sha":"08a9dad268253e50a1cadcb7cbf8848c022e897fd2f5049a2a132d66ff2b30e0","spec_sha":"8a91b002af08072bbdc95fbdf72e73fd461a2140498612204330380237e45c73","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/hypertabular","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/hypertabular-1.1.0.gem","homepage_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular","wiki_uri":null,"documentation_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular/tree/master/ruby#readme","mailing_list_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular/issues","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/SkunkWerkx/HyperTabular/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md","funding_uri":null,"dependencies":{"development":[{"name":"rake","requirement